    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6" data-animate="fade-up">Building the rails for the machine economy</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-8" data-animate="fade-up">PaxLabs Inc. is the team behind Matrix — the agent operating framework that bridges human intent and machine execution.</p>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-muted-foreground" data-animate="fade-up">
      <p>We believe the next wave of computing won't be driven by better prompts — it'll be driven by better compilers. When a human says "do this," the machine needs a typed, inspectable, correctable plan. Not a best guess.</p>
      <p>Matrix is that compiler. It takes natural language, produces typed Intent IR, and executes it deterministically on the Paxeer Network. No prompt fragility. No intent loss. No ambiguity.</p>
      <p>We're a small, focused team of systems engineers, compiler designers, and protocol architects. We ship fast, test rigorously, and believe in open source as the foundation for trust.</p>
    </div>
    
